WEBVTT

NOTE
The Galbadian railway — the long luxury train, with President Deling's decorated carriage.
Duration: approximately 31 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
The camera tracks alongside the train's richly decorated cars.

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:17.570
A distinctive orange-and-gold carriage rushes past green hills.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.090
A wide shot shows the whole train crossing the land, a large moon above.
